  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:13.240" end="00:18.790" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</p>
      <p begin="00:18.790" end="00:22.970" ttm:agent="v1">I been ready, ice all on my neck, Wayne Gretzky, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:22.970" end="00:27.880" ttm:agent="v1">I been ready, and baby, I look like a star, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:27.880" end="00:32.180" ttm:agent="v1">Come and get me, Porsche 911, come arrest me, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:32.180" end="00:34.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Come and cuff me up, baby (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:34.700" end="00:39.340" ttm:agent="v1">All my favorite stars are the ones in your eyes</p>
      <p begin="00:39.340" end="00:43.470" ttm:agent="v1">Constellations dancing every time we collide</p>
      <p begin="00:43.470" end="00:48.160" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, we got time, do whatever you like</p>
      <p begin="00:48.160" end="00:52.460" ttm:agent="v1">She said, &quot;Baby, take my hand, and you can learn how to fly&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:52.460" end="00:57.610" ttm:agent="v1">Let me take you to the moon, boy</p>
      <p begin="00:57.610" end="01:01.840" ttm:agent="v1">Take you to the moon</p>
      <p begin="01:01.840" end="01:06.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">We got nothin' to lose, boy (lose, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.320" end="01:11.770" ttm:agent="v1">Take you to the moon, to the moon, boy, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:11.770" end="01:15.810" ttm:agent="v1">What you want is what I be, what I got is what you need</p>
      <p begin="01:15.810" end="01:19.650" ttm:agent="v1">Boy, come and see, just you and me</p>
      <p begin="01:19.650" end="01:24.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Let me take you to the moon, boy (moon, boy, yeah, yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:24.480" end="01:30.430" ttm:agent="v1">Take you to the moon, to the moon, boy, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:30.430" end="01:35.090" ttm:agent="v1">No rocket ships, no satellites</p>
      <p begin="01:35.090" end="01:38.750" ttm:agent="v1">Just you and me in neon lights</p>
      <p begin="01:38.750" end="01:40.250" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:40.160" end="01:41.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Come and get me (get me)</p>
      <p begin="01:41.710" end="01:44.380" ttm:agent="v1">Porsche 911, come arrest me, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:44.380" end="01:46.770" ttm:agent="v1">Come and cuff me up, baby, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:46.770" end="01:51.690" ttm:agent="v1">All my favorite stars are the ones in your eyes</p>
      <p begin="01:51.690" end="01:55.710" ttm:agent="v1">Constellations dancing every time we collide</p>
      <p begin="01:55.710" end="02:00.400" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, we got time, do whatever you like</p>
      <p begin="02:00.400" end="02:04.920" ttm:agent="v1">She said, &quot;Baby, take my hand, and you can learn how to fly&quot;</p>
      <p begin="02:04.920" end="02:09.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Let me take you to the moon, boy (moon, boy, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="02:09.990" end="02:14.470" ttm:agent="v1">Take you to the moon</p>
